    "This camera doesn’t expose any settings that CamControl can adjust." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Kamera bietet keine Einstellungen, die CamControl steuern kann."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CamControl 无法调节此摄像头的任何设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此相機沒有提供 CamControl 可調整的設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This camera’s settings can’t be adjusted by CamControl. Only cameras connected via USB can be controlled." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Einstellungen dieser Kamera können von CamControl nicht verändert werden. Nur über USB angeschloßene Kameras sind steuerbar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CamControl 无法调节此摄像头的设置。仅支持调节通过 USB 连接的摄像头。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CamControl 無法調整此相機的設定。只有透過 USB 連接的相機才能控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This resets all settings to the camera’s built-in defaults. This can’t be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies setzt die Kamera auf ihre Grundeinstellungen zurück. Es kann nicht rückgängig gemacht werden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会将所有设置恢复为摄像头的出厂默认值。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這會將所有設定重置為相機內建的預設值。此操作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tilt" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Neigen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
